Subject: [PATCH] erofs: handle referrer rotation and signed snapshot ownership

Runtime-only follow-up to erofs-signed-dmverity.patch.

Base: 59c4a384d9503a3d38ddf15d145213f44f04b00e
Source: 7921a707a516d309393db302c8d6f3ff4892cd4f plus staged map initialization
Runtime source tree: e9f8f19926b0d2a2fbb9aac209b429df6031cd89

Select the newest optional referrer without falling back to an older registry
bundle, reject conflicting descriptors, and validate cached payload sizes
before publishing retained-selection or GC metadata.

Bind signed snapshot keys to their signature digest and retain each signed
chain through its selected referrer. Preserve shared-config and per-reference
snapshotter inventory independently, initializing ownership maps under the
store lock on first add.

